{"title":"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One can holds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ounces of soda, what is the minimum number of cans needed to provide a gallon (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed56990dedba5a88a65e21245ccfd5d5e43ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> ounces) of soda?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/51759c5d163f15c81016db64d956313190af02c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cans would hold <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> ounces, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2ba4fba5d31a8e7bc362b935d410dcf8dccb51c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128&gt;120$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cans are required. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5abdecb0c5d3fb0a0b8bb683bfcac06850020d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{\\boxed{{(E)}11}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d16f4363cc8429f2a47a9ca36db90e26fb6368e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil\\frac{128}{12}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"47\" height=\"43\" /> because there are a whole number of cans.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b24810788b71cf766606d2a8716ea8bf42967e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{128}{12} = 10R8\\longrightarrow 11\\longrightarrow \\fbox{(E)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"232\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A\">2009 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a 